      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋikeyokok ŋiarei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro ŋuna irworo Ekapolon Akuj kaŋ ikes nu, “Toruwor ekeyokon a ŋamesekin a ŋuna erae toŋolae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋituŋa ŋulu egyelununeete ŋamesekin ŋun, eŋolete, ido kimyekinitetei nyisicana; tobasi ŋulu egyelanarete akiriŋ a ŋamesekin a ŋun ebe, ‘Kipuroe Ekapolon, anerae abar ayoŋ.’ Emam akisyon eyakatar tari ŋikeyokok neni a ŋamesekin kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emam nabo ituŋanan eroko ayoŋ esyoni anakwap. Emyekini ayoŋ ŋituŋa kipukata ŋulu epolokinito ikes. Emunaarete ŋikepukak ŋul akwap, ido nyaiuni ayoŋ ŋituŋa anapedor a ŋikepukak kec.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ŋimucurus a ŋamesekin a ŋuna erae toŋolae okolimokis ayoŋ acok ŋamesekin kec, ido abu ayoŋ oruwor ekeyokon a ŋamesekin a ŋun. Abu ayoŋ olemu ŋibelae ŋiarei, onyara ekiro ke epei ebe, “Ajokis” ka ŋoloce ebe, “Akimorikina,” Abu ayoŋ eyok ŋamesekin ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma elap epei, abu ayoŋ oar ŋikeyokok a ŋamesekin ŋiuni anerae abu okoup ayoŋ akidaŋidaŋ ŋakiro kec, apotu daŋ ŋamesekin okoremokin ayoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu ayoŋ olimok ŋamesekin ebe, “Nyaruwor nabo ayoŋ jik ekeyokon kus. Kimyekisi ŋuna erae totwaka totwaka, ŋuna erae tomunyarae tomunyarae, ŋuna idoŋete daŋ emunyarosi ikes make.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ayoŋ olemu ebela ŋolo enyaritae “Ajokis” ido obil aŋuna ka akikisar acamunet ŋina abu ayoŋ ocamunotor ka ŋakwapin daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, aponi kikisarae acamunet akoloŋit ŋin. Eteete ŋimucurus a ŋamesekin etiyae ayoŋ ŋun, ido apotu toyenut atemar erworo Ekapolon alotooma ŋuna etiyae ayoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ayoŋ otema neni kec, “Ani kejok aneni kus, inakinae ayoŋ eropit kaŋ; nai ani pa kejok, yaasi iŋes.” Aŋun, apotu ikes okoinakis ayoŋ ŋisilipae ŋatomoniuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon neni kaŋ, “Kimasak ŋisilipae ŋul neni a eketiyan ŋamoti a ebari a ŋolo ka Akai ka Akuj.” Aŋun, abu ayoŋ olemu ŋisilipae ŋul ŋatomoniuni etyae ŋolo atamakinito ikes atemar akagyelere ayoŋ, abu ayoŋ olemu ŋisilipae ŋul, emasak Kai ka Akuj, neni a eketiyan ŋamoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku, abu ayoŋ obil ebela ŋolo a ŋiarei ŋolo anyaritae “Akimorikina”, ido abu akimorikina a Yudaya ka Isirael tomunaar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon tema neni kaŋ, “Tolemu nabo ŋiboro ŋulu a ekeyokon a ŋolobaŋaanot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae alosi ayoŋ alemun ekeyokon ŋolo iyoki akwap, nai nyepedori iŋes akiyok ŋulu adaut aoliyor, kori akiwarar ŋulu cicik, kori akimadun ŋulu ewanan, kori akitan ŋulu eŋaleete, nai enyami iŋes akiriŋ a ŋamesekin a ŋuna atumak, erutonori ŋigece kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
